{"id":"vod_lz_59214","vodId":"59214","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"WWW.迷糊餐厅","name_cn":"WWW.迷糊餐厅","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230428-1/cfcf7401a0da02a1c2f34bce5b245485.jpg"},"summary":"东田大辅（中村悠一 配音）是一位平凡不起眼的男子，因为家境实在贫困，于是不得不来到一间家庭餐厅打工以维持生计。东田虽然其貌不扬，却有着十分认真踏实的性格，因此深受上司和后辈的信赖。然而没过多久，东田就发现，这间看似普通的餐厅，其实有着非常大的问题。　　工作出色的女高中生领班宫越华（户松遥 配音）、活泼开朗的千金大小姐镰仓志保（雨宫天 配音）、浑身散发着魅力的轻浮男公关进藤祐太（小野贤章 配音）、沉默寡言拥有着超强灵能力的村主小百合（日笠阳子 配音），餐厅里唯一的正常人足立正广（内山昂辉 配音），在这些人的围绕下，东田会迎来怎样的打工生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-28 16:41:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18692_540c604a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230426/18992_3d67fa1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18693_df45defb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18696_975f8569/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230426/18993_281276cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18699_11526b66/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230426/18994_a8f6de0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18700_d8f25d79/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18703_8d0d95c1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18702_759ddc94/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18701_eb0daf04/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230425/18704_ecd9f967/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230426/18995_37a70062/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:19.173Z"}